        { q: "What law explains why the hype stops working?", a: "Anything that works quickly will work less and less well the longer you keep doing it, and the bigger and faster the success, the quicker and more complete the fade." },
        { q: "How long should your advertising plan be?", a: "Exactly as long as your business plan. Don't buy Thursday ads for a Wednesday concert, and don't buy a 13-week schedule for a business that plans to last longer than 13 weeks." }
