          model: "**Silent (price-only and in-market customers):** Google Search ads on \"botox near me,\" the email/SMS list of past clients, and retargeting to booking-page visitors. Each shows a clean image of the treatment and the special, with the spa's name small.\n\n**Intrusive (switchable customers):** Meta and Instagram Reels where the nurse injector explains her \"less is more\" philosophy, plus before/after stories about natural results. Never a price.\n\n**Budget and pain:** total ad spend runs about 40% above normal for 3–6 months, and some months the specials underperform. **Recovery metric:** the share of appointments booked at full price, and the number of new clients who never ask about a special. The goal is to shrink the specials budget every month once the brand ads start pulling."
