        title: "The PMT creative brainstorm",
        before: "\"Hey, can we hop on a call tomorrow at 2 to brainstorm some ad ideas?\"",
        after: "\"Tomorrow, 2 p.m., 30 minutes: new ad ideas for spring.\n\n**The issue:** beginners who inquire but don't book. About 40% of inquiries go quiet.\n**What we know:** most say they're nervous. Our best ad so far featured a real student's first ride.\n**Please come with answers to:** 1. What's the most common fear you hear on Saturday morning? 2. Tell me about one student who surprised you. 3. What do you say to calm someone down in the first 10 minutes?\n**Goal:** three true stories we could film this month.\"",
