          model: "1. \"Would you pay more for a same-day appointment?\" → Test: offer a $49 same-day option on the booking page for two weeks and count how many people choose it.\n2. \"What matters most to you in a dentist?\" → \"Why did you leave your last dentist? What happened?\"\n3. \"Would you like a monthly membership?\" → Pre-sell it: \"First 20 founding members, $X/month,\" and count the sign-ups.\n4. \"Do you prefer text or email?\" → Send the same reminder both ways to half the list each and compare response rates.\n\nThe principle: people's answers describe who they believe they are. Their actions show who they are."
