          model: "**Dentist.**\n\n**Anapest:** \"If you've put it off for years, we'll take care of the fears\": if-you've-PUT / it-off-for-YEARS / we'll-take-CARE / of-the-FEARS.\n\n**Humor:** \"Our most common patient review: 'Wait, you're already done?'\"\n\n**Drama:** \"Imagine sitting down and the first thing anyone asks you is 'What's the worst dental experience you've ever had?' Then they actually listen.\"\n\n**Association swap:** \"Painless dentistry\" → \"Gentle dentistry.\" *Painless* puts the word *pain* in the patient's mind; *gentle* summons soft hands and care.\n\n**Test first:** the association swap. It's the cheapest change and works through the unguarded window."
