        "The frameline is the edge of the picture. When something extends past it, the imagination fills in the rest.",
        "Reggie's spider poem: the word never spoken was the one everyone heard.",
        "Woody's ad left out the address and phone number and ended with \"Okay, I'm done.\" People talked about it for over a decade.",
        "What's left out, the audience supplies, and they believe what they supply.",
        "Talk low, talk slow and don't say too much. Online, the CTA button can carry the logistics."
